In addition to requesting an investigation into these violations, I am also requesting that all accounts associated with Jefferson Capital Systems , LLC be immediately deleted from my credit report. The inaccurate reporting of this debt is causing significant harm to my creditworthiness, and Emotional state and I urge the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau to take swift action in rectifying this matter. 

