8628642,2024-03-27,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Improper use of your report,Reporting company used your report improperly,"On XX/XX/2024 I sent a certified letter to AES stating : RE : Account # XXXX Pursuant to Section 603 ( d ) ( 2 ) ( A ) ( iii ) of the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ) and 12 CFR 1016.10 ( a ) ( 1 ) ( i ) ( iv ) ( b ) and ( c ) there are requirements that must be met when informing consumers of their rights and the limits on disclosure of nonpublic personal information to nonaffiliated third parties. Your companys failure to comply with mandated laws has resulted in unlawful reporting of information to my consumer reports. 
